<title>CHINA: Average monthly increase of China deposits down.</title>
<headline>Average monthly increase of China deposits down.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average monthly increase of China's bank deposits fell to 54.2 billion yuan ($6.53 billion) in the third quarter compared with 119.65 billion yuan in the first quarter, the China Securites newspaper said on Monday.</p>
<p>The newspaper attributed the drop in bank deposits to two interest rate cuts this year by the central bank. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
